# 🔥 Daily Streak System — Snapchat-Style Engagement

A daily activity streak shown in the Navbar, designed to create a habit loop and make users come back every day.

## Core Concept

The streak tracks whether a user **did something meaningful** on the platform each day. Any qualifying action counts — they don't need to do all of them, just **one per day** to maintain the streak. Like Snapchat, the streak counter is always visible in the header with a fire emoji and animated effects.

### What Counts as Activity (any 1 per day)
- Viewed a job listing
- Applied to a job / saved a job
- Generated a resume or cover letter
- Ran an ATS scan or deep evaluation
- Completed a skill quiz in Aptitude Arena
- Logged a daily commit activity
- Updated their profile or settings
- Used any AI tool
- Searched HR contacts

