## Proposed Changes

### 1. Database — New Migration

#### [NEW] `supabase/migrations/48_user_streaks.sql`

```sql
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS user_streaks (
  id              UUID PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT uuid_generate_v4(),
  user_id         UUID NOT NULL UNIQUE REFERENCES users(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,
  current_streak  INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  longest_streak  INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  last_active_date DATE,                     -- last date user performed a qualifying action
  total_active_days INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  streak_level    TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'spark'
                  CHECK (streak_level IN ('spark','flame','blaze','inferno','legendary')),
  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW(),
  updated_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT NOW()
);

CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_user_streaks_user ON user_streaks(user_id);
```

**Streak levels** (visual tiers):
| Days | Level | Emoji | Effect |
|------|-------|-------|--------|
| 1–2 | Spark | 🔥 | Static fire |
| 3–6 | Flame | 🔥 | Gentle pulse |
| 7–13 | Blaze | 🔥🔥 | Orange glow + pulse |
| 14–29 | Inferno | 🔥🔥🔥 | Red/orange gradient + shimmer |
| 30+ | Legendary | ⚡🔥 | Rainbow shimmer + particle-like glow |

