### 4. Auto-Tracking (Silent Heartbeat)

The streak is bumped automatically when the user simply **visits the dashboard**. No extra clicks needed. The `<StreakBadge>` component itself will:

1. `GET /api/streak` on mount → display current streak
2. `POST /api/streak` on mount → record today's visit (idempotent)

This means any page load inside the dashboard layout counts. Passive and frictionless.

